4.4 Candidate and assessor packs

Candidate and Assessor Packs are available on the secure website for centres to download. Centres
have flexibility in when they schedule internal assessment but must ensure that they are using the
correct packs for the series in which they intend to enter the work for moderation. Candidates must
not have access to the Candidate Packs until they are ready for assessment which should be after all
the teaching and learning for the unit has been completed.

