5.1 Guided Learning Hours

Guided Learning Hours (GLH) means activities such as classroom-based learning, tutorials and online
learning, which are directly supervised by a teacher, tutor or invigilator. It also includes all forms of
assessment which take place under the immediate guidance or supervision of a teacher, supervisor or
invigilator.

The total number of GLH assigned to this qualification is 120 hours.

