5.2 Total Qualification Time

Total Qualification Time (TQT) is the total amount of time, in hours, expected to be spent by a learner
to achieve a qualification. It includes both the Guided Learning Hours (GLH) and additional time spent
in preparation, study and some formative assessment activities.

The Total Qualification Time for this qualification has been calculated as 180 hours. This includes:
